{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "4e3f485389a6999ac8ef2e4daf191e39f6aa4a44f73a8561df62f38a50aba4d6", "ja": "美也の主張", "zh": "美也的主张", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4903ea85d8029fd560ce148996bf21a59dc542d5de5f6afd50aeda3d8bf593af", "ja": "美也とのミーティングを兼ねた散歩配信の\n手伝い。実はファン向けの道案内を兼ねて\nいた配信を終え、渡されたセトリはやはり\n美也が主演のような構成。しかも3人とも\nお互いの希望を知った上でのことだった。", "zh": "协助进行兼作与美也开会的散步直播。其实这场直播也兼顾了为粉丝指路；直播结束后，拿到的歌单果然是以美也为主演般的编排。而且这还是在与3人互相了解彼此心愿的基础上决定的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "21554065d3a8641ea1b4224aa8707428f6896edddf5d82c2e98ec843fbad1bd4", "ja": "美也とのミーティング……", "zh": "和美也的会议……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "66caa860b28722be2b2abbf4bad3d08f8c002550b6ec1a9d7ef8ef5a22900318", "ja": "えっと、これで大丈夫だな。\nそれじゃ、配信を始めるぞ！", "zh": "嗯，这样就没问题了。\n那么，开始直播吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "afb24d5510c2672885dc41ff8527af8e04f76daa117d6236e1379b6a8998dc77", "ja": "はい、よろしくお願いします～。", "zh": "好的，拜托您了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1003_se", "source_sha256": "266cd67c963d9a9fe45947dd16154287c2311994b183ebb6f789035f510f57ef", "ja": "ポチッ", "zh": "（按下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "3a61f71b779536ffc4b47f553a025a65595022c7f7a76d586282607e516635c7", "ja": "みなさん、おはようございます～。\n宮尾美也です～。", "zh": "大家早上好～\n我是宫尾美也～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "55fdc55d8c6cda1e195374aac8b286639dce27d2ebe2aae7c36740d37eff39ef", "ja": "今日はプロデューサーさんが配信を担当して\nくれているので、全身が映りますよ～。むふふ♪", "zh": "今天由制作人负责直播，所以会拍到全身哦～。呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "67fc103fcb4734dd6456ea9dab5294e1c0cc3ecafebf7046737932793f6b7dbe", "ja": "それでは、宮尾美也の散歩配信、\n今日も元気にいきましょう～。", "zh": "那么，宫尾美也的散步直播，今天也精神满满地开始吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "be7a7df62cfc3aac1e5880351106ef4c22fb24c74bd94b0d8aed7cb383a904b6", "ja": "（美也は最近、毎朝生配信をしている。\n内容は、要するに散歩なんだけど……）", "zh": "（美也最近每天早上都在直播。\n内容说白了就是散步，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "e1deb641978822cea9aa364861286e2f2dec937751adef33f2eaeb61a5782055", "ja": "今日はとっても気持ちいいお天気ですね～。\n絶好の散歩日和ですな～。", "zh": "今天的天气真是舒服呀～  \n是最适合散步的好天气了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "396111ba4ae9d376c2956c4f23e281a7e6a05e5b74df1a416d269f8c47269b73", "ja": "ここの交差点は交通量が多いので、\n気をつけましょう～。", "zh": "这里的十字路口车流量很大，要小心哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "feacfc94b3dc617b12869a233f660cee9e8960c8713615bf5e5e412decf8c770", "ja": "焦らず、慌てずですよ～。信号が青になっても、\n右見て左見て、もう一度右を見てから進みましょう～。", "zh": "不要着急，也不要慌张哦～就算信号灯变绿了，也要先看看右边，再看看左边，最后再看一次右边，然后再走哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "da5244fc3f1b812ab34c9e73e7787e531b9983d36fed2f4dfd09424045f6d38b", "ja": "（本当に穏やかな散歩そのもの……\n美也らしい配信だな）", "zh": "（真是完全就是一场悠闲的散步……很有美也风格的直播啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "d7748bd72731af0f440c69359c7b06b5b37f9aaa2a6bc20413e7dc97d7d680d3", "ja": "お～、水上バスが見えますよ～。\n劇場の近くには乗り場もあるんです～。", "zh": "哦～，看到水上巴士了哦～  \n剧场附近也有乘船处呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "e78c1e7b5b01d4f2490dfceaf1d550dbaa4e2f83c2585014bb6771092bd5a7e3", "ja": "なので、今度あれに乗ってみるのも\nいいかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "所以，下次也许可以去坐坐那个呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "3aad6f4c4ddbafa03194d893cde05988ea21dce9182f02f04e80585233de0bc6", "ja": "到着です～。今日は駅から劇場まで、\n実際に歩いてみましたよ～。", "zh": "到达啦～今天从车站到剧场，实际走了一遍哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "c2234bdc96246642172c2b51f97be6fbeb75a51ec8d167d1b08aa868fc87375d", "ja": "これで、初めて劇場に行く時でも\n心配いりませんな～。", "zh": "这样一来，就算是第一次去剧场也不用担心啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "c5e26e2c9b644a14f3a8d5e031aab5ff3ca91aaae940bb449d28f4333139ffea", "ja": "ぜひ今日の散歩動画を参考に、\n私達の新曲公演を観に来てくださいね～。", "zh": "请务必参考今天的散步视频，来看我们的新歌公演哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "cc77646d26fcb34154aa0ed5665c576e0d982fdf6dd7d8b68d9c7150dd309107", "ja": "（おお……！）", "zh": "（喔喔……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "70c9681a1c7d357235dc6d613a620235b4e8afec3fd0c468a4350c5c9fc0a6f9", "ja": "予報によると、今日は一日中晴れみたいです～。\n一駅分歩いてみても気持ちいいかもしれません。", "zh": "根据天气预报，今天一整天似乎都会是晴天～。\n走一站路，说不定感觉也会很舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "1895bac6c48676e3903b0313b7a25ec5b555119b8ba1b30c50c21e2649130989", "ja": "それではみなさん、\n今日も元気に、いってらっしゃ～い！", "zh": "那么各位，\n今天也要精神满满地出发哦，路上小心～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "d5d1587b90eefbb39925a734de5dea5274975b7e41791ec8c3b18fb8f4ba59a2", "ja": "劇場への道案内を兼ねた宣伝だったのか。\nよく思いついたな、美也！", "zh": "原来是兼作剧场路线指引的宣传啊。真亏你想得到，美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "2131c95ef8e47714b5a31736eb03dc64f950389e8e744ad046bd28e014e677a8", "ja": "お散歩配信のついでに、劇場への道案内ができれば\n一石二鳥ですからな～。むふふ♪", "zh": "顺便做散步直播，要是还能给大家指路去剧场，就一举两得了～。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "17a9d886ef06521b7e7828531bbd7647248f62a0424cad2db2755a4b912555a9", "ja": "もしかしたら、前に朝の番組に出してもらった\nおかげで、思いつけたのかもしれません～。", "zh": "说不定，多亏了之前能上早间节目，\n我才想得出这个主意呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "6473927a9addae68d1156f179e21b5ed57075966377e9b193d1b60b584e986e5", "ja": "Team5thのみんなに出演してもらった朝番組か。\n生放送で、みんなで早起きして……。", "zh": "是Team5th的大家参加过的那档早间节目啊。\n当时是直播，大家起得都很早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "b1019abf59e34224110ae4b41801d86b423c966e3ede25fea7036b469af43309", "ja": "はい～。朝の番組は、毎日の通勤や通学の前に、\n毎日見てくれる人が必ずいますからね～。", "zh": "是的～每天上班或上学前，  \n总会有人每天观看早间节目的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "0cfe646b3202f2c1c916bc1eb327a96bbc5c16a5dd8ba50283aa23e30a502958", "ja": "いつもと同じに見えて、少しだけ違う何か……。\nそんな朝の発見があると、毎日楽しいと思うんです～。", "zh": "看起来和往常一样，却又有一点点不同……\n要是早上能有这样的发现，每天都会很开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "f41cd1fc458601c5945a2729703a238518869e9e1ec8e4305d59416d78bfcdde", "ja": "なので、毎日ほんの少しだけ違う何かが見つかるような\n……そんな配信がしたいと思ってるんですよ～。", "zh": "所以，我想做那种每天都能发现些许不同之处的……这样的直播哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "5d3898274b28de98108059045bfef52f05e8791cd0e64a5a02f14795997840ab", "ja": "そっか……。\nうん、やっぱり、間違いない。", "zh": "这样啊……\n嗯，果然没错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "263807054be1e8fe372ceffd1fbc2d497281885f48bbdfb908df00d19ac8c08a", "ja": "？　何がですか～？", "zh": "？什么呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "02daca5c52b5dfa8c8c85777c02c7d4506e265788b12cf3682bea47f3b2a1885", "ja": "美也は本当に……。\nいや、朋花もまつりも。", "zh": "美也真是……不，朋花和茉莉也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "4eb86773ca4135f83ea72be3b89d91d5776c640f521a224b7bfbf81a7fee65a6", "ja": "3人とも、本当に……、アイドルだ！", "zh": "你们3个人，真的都是……不折不扣的偶像啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "5a82a3aad23f7e6e0d61806bbaf3cbb227be127b59bbfce6a0e04b5a3d2abcb6", "ja": "……。ふふっ。そんな風に褒めてもらえるとは\n思いませんでした。なんだかくすぐったいですな～。", "zh": "……呵呵，没想到您会这样夸奖我。总觉得怪不好意思的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd957da6541403ac3eda5589e28832c55320891d1049fdd2715ed0f67e96eade", "ja": "でも……。とってもとっても、嬉しいです～。\nプロデューサーさん、ありがとうございます～♪", "zh": "不过……我真的真的特别开心～。\n制作人，谢谢你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0433_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0433_story_04_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "5d4e7808e62ff7d0bdaa69f3057f83b43d5c5a30b878ab7b9999afdd0092589e", "ja": "こちらこそ。\n新曲公演、本当に楽しみにしてるよ！", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。\n我非常期待新歌公演哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
